Scope of this licence

This MIT licence covers the source code of this repository only (shared/,
pipeline/, backend/, frontend/, infra/, scripts/, config/ and the docs).

It does NOT cover anything under data/. The site records, raw source
responses and boundary files there come from third parties and keep their
own licences (Open Database License 1.0, CC0 1.0, CC BY); see
data/LICENSE-DATA.md.

Third-party npm packages keep their own licences. The bundled web fonts
(@fontsource/inter, @fontsource/cormorant-garamond) are under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1. Images shown by the app are linked from Wikimedia Commons,
not included, and each keeps its own per-file licence.
